{
  "$comment": "Named map regions for `install.py --region` and `content.py add --region`. bbox is west,south,east,north in degrees (a box, so neighbours' border areas come along). map_mb: size of the detailed map at that max zoom, measured with `pmtiles extract --dry-run` on the 2026-08 Protomaps build. routing_mb is a rough estimate of the built Valhalla tiles. countries: GeoNames codes for the places database. geofabrik: OpenStreetMap extracts for the routing build. Street-address search uses US Census TIGER and Statistics Canada data, so it exists only for regions marked addresses: true. Any other area works too for the map: pass --bbox W,S,E,N instead of a name (routing and the places database need a named region).",
